OL,3,ATrump barred from closing 'Trash
OL,4,AIsland' golf course on Sunday
OL,5,
OL,6,FA federal judge has temporarily blocked
OL,7,Fthe US government's closure of an
OL,8,Fhistoric golf course and park in
OL,9,FWashington DC.
OL,11,FUS District Judge Ana Reyes has been
OL,12,Foverseeing a months-long challenge to
OL,13,Fthe president's plans for East Potomac
OL,14,FGolf Links, which he said would be
OL,15,Fclosed from 15 November for extensive
OL,16,Frenovations.
OL,18,FReyes has said President Donald Trump
OL,19,Fcannot close the park nor its golf
OL,20,Fcourse, but added that his
OL,21,Fadministration was not required to
OL,22,Factively manage either.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
