OL,3,ATrump barred from closing 'Trash
OL,4,AIsland' golf course on Sunday
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump, an avid golfer, has said his
OL,7,Fplans to upgrade the 106-year-old
OL,8,Fcourse will create "one of the Best and
OL,9,FMost Spectacular Golf Courses anywhere
OL,10,Fin the World". The BBC has contacted
OL,11,Fthe White House for comment.
